 "thousand kitchens never meet. The sentence to say next is the one that shows you know what you are defending: what "
 "would ruin it is not the number of customers, it is putting the card gateway inside the lock &mdash; four hundred "
 "milliseconds is two hundred thousand times longer than the critical section, you would never see it in testing at "
