 "the new one, never a torn one, which is all a status screen needs. Be precise about which reads those are: "
 "<code>stamps()</code> takes the order's lock to copy the timestamp map, and the menu, the stock and the tablet's "
 "queue are copied under the restaurant's lock. That is deliberate. Those are opened a few times per order; the "
 "status poll is a thousand times a second, and it is the only one that had to be free.",
